      "excerpt": "Biodiversity is the diversity of life on the planet. This includes plants, animals, insects, microbes, and the environments associated with them. The importance of appropriate biodiversity cannot be overstated. One of the easiest and most effective methods for preserving biodiversity is through the type of plants we grow in our garden and parks.",
